1
00:00:05,391 --> 00:00:06,700
Phobthee, you need to lead our team to that place

2
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,360
and detain important members for negotiation.

3
00:00:09,674 --> 00:00:11,720
The leader should be a person who is close to Kitti,

4
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:12,761
Captain Phobthee.

5
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,300
If they break in, you can shoot them all.

6
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,401
Phob!

7
00:00:18,419 --> 00:00:20,360
Go to hell!

8
00:00:23,107 --> 00:00:24,686
Your Highness!

9
00:00:25,187 --> 00:00:26,188
- Your Highness.
- Phob.

10
00:00:26,238 --> 00:00:28,040
Your Phob is right here with you.

11
00:00:28,675 --> 00:00:30,800
And I won't leave your side, ever.

12
00:00:34,614 --> 00:00:35,760
Captain Phobthee?

13
00:00:35,846 --> 00:00:37,840
Why are you here for?

14
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:39,240
I don’t have to visit him because of work merely,

15
00:00:39,579 --> 00:00:41,400
perhaps I can visit him when I miss him.

16
00:02:13,279 --> 00:02:16,639
This is profit from your first coal mining business' investment, Your Highness.

17
00:02:18,479 --> 00:02:20,039
I got this much profit from the first month?

18
00:02:21,421 --> 00:02:24,799
I think it's because of your luck.

19
00:02:26,359 --> 00:02:28,599
I am hesitating if I should

20
00:02:28,674 --> 00:02:30,759
invest some more.

21
00:02:31,871 --> 00:02:34,399
I want to gain more profits.

22
00:02:37,135 --> 00:02:40,479
You would be stupid if you didn't invest more.

23
00:02:40,929 --> 00:02:43,919
Here, put this money into my share and I will find more to invest.

24
00:02:44,359 --> 00:02:45,959
I still have money from the ministry's budget.

25
00:02:46,317 --> 00:02:47,586
Oh wow!

26
00:02:47,821 --> 00:02:50,119
You're so brilliant.

27
00:02:50,423 --> 00:02:53,639
I can guarantee you that by June,

28
00:02:54,098 --> 00:02:55,479
we both will be so wealthy.

29
00:02:57,293 --> 00:02:58,959
Come on, cheers!

30
00:03:05,967 --> 00:03:07,549
Everyone will finally realize

31
00:03:07,786 --> 00:03:11,319
that I didn't have to do well in school like Tin and Phob,

32
00:03:11,839 --> 00:03:13,959
still I can make more money than they can.

33
00:03:15,797 --> 00:03:18,199
And my dad will finally praise me.

34
00:03:19,727 --> 00:03:21,119
Let's cheers again!

35
00:03:21,332 --> 00:03:22,333
Let's get rich!

36
00:03:38,323 --> 00:03:39,639
You used work as an excuse

37
00:03:40,877 --> 00:03:42,999
to be around my son all the time.

38
00:03:43,541 --> 00:03:46,279
If that's the case, what are you going to do about it?

39
00:03:46,469 --> 00:03:47,470
Phob!

40
00:03:48,565 --> 00:03:50,366
You need to stop being around Tinnakorn already.

41
00:03:50,954 --> 00:03:52,179
Let him go.

42
00:03:52,205 --> 00:03:54,039
I am not a servant in your palace.

43
00:03:54,893 --> 00:03:57,119
I don’t have to do what you say.

44
00:03:57,922 --> 00:03:58,924
Also,

45
00:03:59,831 --> 00:04:00,832
Prine Tinnakorn

46
00:04:01,421 --> 00:04:03,159
risked his life to save mine.

47
00:04:04,589 --> 00:04:06,039
He was so brave to save me.

48
00:04:07,426 --> 00:04:09,759
You can't expect me to leave him just like that.

49
00:04:29,047 --> 00:04:30,359
Chat?

50
00:04:30,535 --> 00:04:32,719
Whose car is this?

51
00:04:34,146 --> 00:04:35,919
This is my car, Grandma.

52
00:04:37,767 --> 00:04:40,121
I invested in mining business with my friend.

53
00:04:40,237 --> 00:04:42,359
I thought that I'd buy a small car but

54
00:04:42,914 --> 00:04:46,879
I made a lot of profit so I decided to buy the same model and color as my dad's.

55
00:04:47,146 --> 00:04:49,199
Wonderful.

56
00:04:49,402 --> 00:04:52,679
This one is for you.

57
00:04:56,295 --> 00:04:57,439
For me?

58
00:05:00,530 --> 00:05:01,531
- That's right.
- Thanks, honey.

59
00:05:01,842 --> 00:05:05,579
Thank you so much. I wish you big success in your business.

60
00:05:05,751 --> 00:05:07,919
- Thank you. Hey, Aum.
- Yes?

61
00:05:08,231 --> 00:05:11,639
Tell the servants to meet me in the main building.

62
00:05:11,898 --> 00:05:13,759
I have some gifts for everyone.

63
00:05:13,863 --> 00:05:16,239
Sure, Your Highness. Thank you.

64
00:05:17,133 --> 00:05:19,799
Well done.

65
00:05:20,434 --> 00:05:21,435
Dad?

66
00:05:23,783 --> 00:05:25,319
I have invested

67
00:05:25,513 --> 00:05:27,919
in mining business with my friends and I gained a lot of profit.

68
00:05:28,029 --> 00:05:29,959
So I bought a new car

69
00:05:30,045 --> 00:05:32,599
it is the same model and the same color as yours.

70
00:05:32,646 --> 00:05:33,647
Isn't she pretty?

71
00:05:34,861 --> 00:05:36,962
Are you sure that it is from the business investment?

72
00:05:37,207 --> 00:05:40,039
It wasn't from your gambling money? Don't drag us to your problems.

73
00:05:40,445 --> 00:05:42,039
Vasin,

74
00:05:42,141 --> 00:05:44,479
don't be too harsh on him,

75
00:05:44,579 --> 00:05:45,580
okay?

76
00:05:49,350 --> 00:05:50,845
- Aum?
- Yes, Your Highness.

77
00:05:51,213 --> 00:05:53,599
If Tinnakorn is here, tell him to see me.

78
00:05:53,885 --> 00:05:54,886
Yes, Your Highness.

79
00:06:01,274 --> 00:06:02,719
My dad has never cared about me.

80
00:06:03,890 --> 00:06:06,319
He has never praised me, he only cares about Tinnakorn.

81
00:06:07,451 --> 00:06:09,119
Come on, don't be sad.

82
00:06:09,207 --> 00:06:12,479
He just came back from work, he must be exhausted.

83
00:06:12,773 --> 00:06:13,774
Okay?

84
00:06:16,639 --> 00:06:17,919
Grandma, you have to see it.

85
00:06:18,586 --> 00:06:19,914
I will make a lot of money

86
00:06:20,626 --> 00:06:23,329
and I will show my dad that I can do well in my life.

87
00:06:23,997 --> 00:06:25,999
I will bring good reputation to the family.

88
00:06:26,711 --> 00:06:28,999
I will, I can't wait to see it.

89
00:06:29,066 --> 00:06:30,719
I wish your dream comes true.

90
00:06:30,767 --> 00:06:33,839
- I love you the most.
- I love you, too.

91
00:06:33,861 --> 00:06:35,799
Let's try it on. I want to see it.

92
00:06:40,362 --> 00:06:42,363
Aum told me that you wanted to see me.

93
00:06:42,839 --> 00:06:43,840
Is everything okay?

94
00:06:45,375 --> 00:06:46,376
Have a seat.

95
00:06:51,525 --> 00:06:55,399
A nephew of my colleague will come back from England last week.

96
00:06:56,661 --> 00:06:58,559
I am looking for a right job for him.

97
00:07:00,866 --> 00:07:02,399
I think this is a good opportunity

98
00:07:02,409 --> 00:07:04,559
that he can replace you at work.

99
00:07:05,837 --> 00:07:06,919
What do you mean?

100
00:07:09,895 --> 00:07:10,896
You need to resign,

101
00:07:12,039 --> 00:07:12,900
and stay home.

102
00:07:14,031 --> 00:07:15,519
while I'm looking for a new position for you.

103
00:07:16,559 --> 00:07:17,560
A new position?

104
00:07:22,141 --> 00:07:25,117
A new position that I don't have to be involved with Phobthee?

105
00:07:25,245 --> 00:07:26,246
That's right.

106
00:07:26,557 --> 00:07:28,239
Why are you doing this?

107
00:07:29,759 --> 00:07:31,119
You need to ask yourself.

108
00:07:31,503 --> 00:07:34,079
You took a bullet for him.

109
00:07:34,170 --> 00:07:36,799
You wanted me to let Chat shot him to death?

110
00:07:36,965 --> 00:07:37,966
Tinnakorn,

111
00:07:38,613 --> 00:07:41,279
you know the real reason why you saved him.

112
00:07:41,690 --> 00:07:43,199
It wasn't because of humanity.

113
00:07:43,861 --> 00:07:45,567
But it was because you didn't forget him.

114
00:07:48,826 --> 00:07:50,879
You should have forgotten all about him.

115
00:07:51,770 --> 00:07:54,199
You should have stopped loving him or thinking about him.

116
00:07:55,082 --> 00:07:57,919
You need to protect the family's honor.

117
00:07:58,634 --> 00:08:00,201
The family's honor?

118
00:08:02,077 --> 00:08:05,159
Why does the family's honor feel so heavy on my shoulders?

119
00:08:06,978 --> 00:08:08,879
I can't even

120
00:08:09,719 --> 00:08:11,839
think about him

121
00:08:12,661 --> 00:08:14,199
- or keep him in my memories.
- Tinnakorn!

122
00:08:18,437 --> 00:08:20,919
Actually, if you want me to forget all about this,

123
00:08:20,979 --> 00:08:22,229
there is another way.

124
00:08:23,637 --> 00:08:24,638
What is it?

125
00:08:30,762 --> 00:08:33,399
You can just kill me.

126
00:08:34,919 --> 00:08:35,920
Tinnakorn!

127
00:09:05,183 --> 00:09:07,818
My prince, where are you?

128
00:09:08,650 --> 00:09:10,199
Where are you?

129
00:09:10,831 --> 00:09:11,832
Are you here?

130
00:09:12,975 --> 00:09:15,959
My prince, where are you?

131
00:09:17,290 --> 00:09:18,419
There you are! I found you!

132
00:09:20,223 --> 00:09:22,330
Oh my! You found me!

133
00:09:22,559 --> 00:09:24,079
No matter where you are

134
00:09:24,253 --> 00:09:26,254
I will always find you.

135
00:09:26,503 --> 00:09:27,504
Phob.

136
00:09:29,458 --> 00:09:30,459
Your Highness.

137
00:09:52,482 --> 00:09:53,483
Oh my gosh!

138
00:09:54,098 --> 00:09:55,199
You don't like it?

139
00:09:55,703 --> 00:09:57,645
It's too cold.

140
00:09:57,743 --> 00:09:59,639
I saw you working hard so I brought you some water,

141
00:09:59,686 --> 00:10:00,687
to freshen you up.

142
00:10:02,125 --> 00:10:03,199
Thank you.

143
00:10:05,986 --> 00:10:06,987
Is it cold enough?

144
00:10:27,847 --> 00:10:28,848
Hey! Phob!

145
00:10:47,119 --> 00:10:48,120
Oh, it stays.

146
00:11:25,311 --> 00:11:26,312
Hey!

147
00:11:28,597 --> 00:11:29,959
Give me your money!

148
00:11:31,711 --> 00:11:33,319
Hurry up, you want to die?

149
00:11:38,079 --> 00:11:39,080
Phob!

150
00:11:39,095 --> 00:11:40,299
- Hey!
- Phob!

151
00:11:41,021 --> 00:11:42,022
Watch out!

152
00:11:48,055 --> 00:11:49,439
Let's go, hurry!

153
00:11:51,799 --> 00:11:52,800
Phob!

154
00:11:56,500 --> 00:11:58,570
Are you hurt? Did they do anything to you?

155
00:11:58,895 --> 00:11:59,896
I'm fine.

156
00:12:02,274 --> 00:12:03,559
Phob! Your blood?

157
00:12:07,154 --> 00:12:08,155
Phob!

158
00:12:09,309 --> 00:12:10,310
I'm fine.

159
00:12:27,453 --> 00:12:28,759
You're safe now.

160
00:13:20,026 --> 00:13:21,027
Thank you, Your Highness.

161
00:13:23,983 --> 00:13:25,079
You should go.

162
00:13:27,519 --> 00:13:28,839
But I think I should…

163
00:13:29,887 --> 00:13:31,919
- I should drive you back to your palace.
- No, you can't.

164
00:13:32,474 --> 00:13:34,005
I can go back tomorrow myself.

165
00:13:34,870 --> 00:13:35,871
But right now, you should go.

166
00:13:38,038 --> 00:13:39,379
- But..
- You should go.

167
00:14:24,685 --> 00:14:25,759
Get home safe, okay?

168
00:14:56,909 --> 00:14:59,359
Is everything okay? Did you forget something?

169
00:15:03,454 --> 00:15:04,455
No, I didn't.

170
00:15:06,426 --> 00:15:07,439
I just think

171
00:15:08,093 --> 00:15:09,279
that I should stay here with you.

172
00:15:09,327 --> 00:15:10,639
It's totally fine, you should go.

173
00:15:11,317 --> 00:15:12,999
- But it's dangerous…
- You need to go.

174
00:15:15,823 --> 00:15:16,824
You need to leave.

175
00:15:19,602 --> 00:15:20,603
Go!

176
00:15:23,415 --> 00:15:24,639
Just go!

177
00:15:25,519 --> 00:15:26,520
Leave me alone!

178
00:15:27,199 --> 00:15:29,903
You need to go! Why did you come back?

179
00:15:33,435 --> 00:15:35,659
Why can't I stay away from you?

180
00:15:37,499 --> 00:15:39,379
I thought that if we never met again,

181
00:15:39,479 --> 00:15:40,899
it would have been easier than this.

182
00:15:42,145 --> 00:15:44,299
I could just see you in my dream.

183
00:15:44,363 --> 00:15:45,619
I could just miss you.

184
00:15:48,035 --> 00:15:50,225
Now you're standing right in front of me. What do you expect me to do?

185
00:15:50,966 --> 00:15:53,419
How do you expect me to forget you?

186
00:16:12,774 --> 00:16:14,139
I used to think that way.

187
00:16:17,449 --> 00:16:20,779
But no matter how long it takes,

188
00:16:24,094 --> 00:16:25,379
I can never forget you.

189
00:16:27,969 --> 00:16:29,179
My heart

190
00:16:31,035 --> 00:16:32,979
always belongs to you.

191
00:16:36,173 --> 00:16:37,469
And it will always belong to you

192
00:16:38,739 --> 00:16:39,740
forever,

193
00:16:41,177 --> 00:16:42,499
it will never change.

194
00:20:15,851 --> 00:20:16,852
Hi,

195
00:20:17,622 --> 00:20:18,623
you're up?

196
00:20:28,095 --> 00:20:30,489
We shouldn't have done this, Phob.

197
00:20:37,398 --> 00:20:38,399
You're right.

198
00:20:39,423 --> 00:20:40,799
We shouldn't have done this.

199
00:20:45,449 --> 00:20:46,850
But I will do this.

200
00:20:49,497 --> 00:20:50,498
Phob!

201
00:20:50,739 --> 00:20:51,740
Stop it.

202
00:20:56,714 --> 00:20:57,819
Do you know

203
00:20:59,539 --> 00:21:01,339
how long I've waited for this moment?

204
00:21:13,374 --> 00:21:14,375
Phob.

205
00:21:14,579 --> 00:21:15,580
Yeah?

206
00:21:16,926 --> 00:21:17,979
I need to tell you something.

207
00:21:21,662 --> 00:21:22,798
I heard about

208
00:21:23,065 --> 00:21:26,219
people trying to transform the national regime.

209
00:21:27,833 --> 00:21:29,339
Have you ever heard of this?

210
00:21:36,705 --> 00:21:37,819
What's the matter?

211
00:21:39,091 --> 00:21:41,659
You can't be around these people.

212
00:21:43,729 --> 00:21:45,339
It is dangerous

213
00:21:47,307 --> 00:21:49,179
and you could be the suspect.

214
00:21:51,110 --> 00:21:52,299
Do you hear me?

215
00:22:19,657 --> 00:22:20,658
Tin.

216
00:22:22,945 --> 00:22:23,946
Dad?

217
00:22:25,963 --> 00:22:27,179
Where have you been all night?

218
00:22:29,836 --> 00:22:31,219
- I…
- About last night,

219
00:22:32,665 --> 00:22:33,666
I'm sorry.

220
00:22:39,342 --> 00:22:42,019
You don't have to apologize to me.

221
00:22:43,907 --> 00:22:47,259
You've sacrificed your happiness for the family's honor.

222
00:22:49,766 --> 00:22:52,059
I shouldn't force you like that.

223
00:22:54,161 --> 00:22:56,139
Instead, I should have been more understanding.

224
00:22:59,758 --> 00:23:01,699
From now on, I won't be involved

225
00:23:02,707 --> 00:23:04,219
with your work anymore.

226
00:23:07,257 --> 00:23:08,258
Dad?

227
00:23:12,761 --> 00:23:14,219
Please forgive me.

228
00:23:45,789 --> 00:23:46,860
Do you like the house?

229
00:23:48,646 --> 00:23:49,647
Yeah.

230
00:23:50,411 --> 00:23:51,651
Let's take a look inside.

231
00:24:28,579 --> 00:24:30,499
This house belongs to Janthorn's relative. It's for rent.

232
00:24:31,641 --> 00:24:32,642
It is isolated.

233
00:24:33,113 --> 00:24:34,114
Don't worry,

234
00:24:34,761 --> 00:24:36,339
nobody can find us here.

235
00:24:38,953 --> 00:24:40,939
We can meet here, what do you think?

236
00:24:44,566 --> 00:24:46,659
If my dad finds out about this,

237
00:24:46,955 --> 00:24:48,099
he must be so mad.

238
00:24:52,241 --> 00:24:53,979
Take it one day at a time.

239
00:24:54,779 --> 00:24:57,680
You know that my dad expects me to take care of the palace.

240
00:24:59,035 --> 00:25:02,259
He loves and worships his family more than anything.

241
00:25:04,939 --> 00:25:06,379
So he puts all the burden

242
00:25:07,153 --> 00:25:08,899
on his son's shoulders?

243
00:25:09,889 --> 00:25:11,139
Don't say that.

244
00:25:12,075 --> 00:25:13,459
It is my job.

245
00:25:16,559 --> 00:25:20,429
You may not have to bear the burden all by yourself in the future.

246
00:25:22,065 --> 00:25:24,059
What do you mean?

247
00:25:26,211 --> 00:25:27,212
Well,

248
00:25:27,987 --> 00:25:28,988
I mean that

249
00:25:31,694 --> 00:25:34,261
I can help with your burden

250
00:25:35,539 --> 00:25:38,339
and I can help with the thing that bothers you.

251
00:25:40,014 --> 00:25:41,015
Sounds good?

252
00:25:44,118 --> 00:25:45,119
I guess.

253
00:26:23,854 --> 00:26:25,679
Now we have cotton rose tree at our house, Phob.

254
00:26:40,995 --> 00:26:41,796
Phob!

255
00:26:41,854 --> 00:26:43,779
- Come on, let me do it.
- No.

256
00:26:43,855 --> 00:26:45,899
Just find something to shield me from oil, hurry.

257
00:26:46,745 --> 00:26:47,746
Put it down.

258
00:26:48,185 --> 00:26:50,139
- Be careful.
- Phob!

259
00:26:59,139 --> 00:27:00,140
Let me taste it.

260
00:27:09,555 --> 00:27:10,556
Are you ready?

261
00:27:12,569 --> 00:27:13,570
Yeah.

262
00:27:17,995 --> 00:27:18,996
How is it?

263
00:27:22,747 --> 00:27:24,635
- Is it good?
- It's good.

264
00:27:24,955 --> 00:27:27,499
If you like it, then you should try this.

265
00:27:33,310 --> 00:27:34,311
- So good.
- I knew it.

266
00:27:34,319 --> 00:27:37,259
I think I cooked it so well. I'm so sure.

267
00:27:37,369 --> 00:27:39,899
Among four dishes, which one is your most favorite?

268
00:27:40,861 --> 00:27:42,939
My most favorite?

269
00:27:44,606 --> 00:27:46,459
I think it is…

270
00:27:53,849 --> 00:27:55,019
That's enough.

271
00:27:56,979 --> 00:27:57,980
Let me try.

272
00:28:06,969 --> 00:28:08,499
- You think this is good?
- Yeah.

273
00:28:08,793 --> 00:28:09,794
You sure?

274
00:28:25,683 --> 00:28:27,479
My prince, come here.

275
00:28:27,593 --> 00:28:29,179
- What is it?
- Come on, hurry.

276
00:28:30,499 --> 00:28:31,819
- What is it?
- Hurry!

277
00:28:35,577 --> 00:28:37,139
- It's here.
- Phob!

278
00:28:39,667 --> 00:28:41,859
The cotton rose that we planted is blooming.

279
00:28:58,555 --> 00:28:59,556
Tinnakorn.

280
00:29:02,513 --> 00:29:03,514
Yes?

281
00:29:05,139 --> 00:29:06,499
Are you leaving the city again?

282
00:29:07,659 --> 00:29:08,660
That's right.

283
00:29:10,230 --> 00:29:12,539
Why do you have to visit the country so often?

284
00:29:13,099 --> 00:29:14,479
You've been gone for a month.

285
00:29:15,379 --> 00:29:16,879
I'm not sure about that.

286
00:29:20,433 --> 00:29:22,219
You should get going, I wont' disturb you.

287
00:29:23,110 --> 00:29:24,111
See you later.

288
00:29:41,033 --> 00:29:42,259
Do you think it will work?

289
00:29:42,779 --> 00:29:43,780
Don't worry.

290
00:29:43,913 --> 00:29:46,939
The students from France planned the whole thing so well.

291
00:29:47,131 --> 00:29:48,819
The national regime transformation

292
00:29:49,132 --> 00:29:50,459
will get done easily.

293
00:29:51,147 --> 00:29:52,659
What are they going to do with the royal family?

294
00:29:53,531 --> 00:29:56,459
They will be executed

295
00:29:57,099 --> 00:29:58,499
and their assets will be confiscated.

296
00:30:00,363 --> 00:30:02,099
Is that so?

297
00:30:02,833 --> 00:30:06,219
Did the two soliders confess about who ordered them?

298
00:30:06,382 --> 00:30:07,383
Not yet, Your Highness.

299
00:30:07,646 --> 00:30:10,019
But I contacted the head of police department already.

300
00:30:10,329 --> 00:30:12,873
If they spilled the names of their underground leaders,

301
00:30:13,081 --> 00:30:14,379
the arrest warrant will be issued.

302
00:30:17,017 --> 00:30:18,429
They were so drunk and they spilled the plan.

303
00:30:19,810 --> 00:30:21,679
They claimed that they were progressive

304
00:30:21,711 --> 00:30:23,179
but they made a stupid mistake.

305
00:30:23,598 --> 00:30:26,079
We need to tackle the root

306
00:30:26,099 --> 00:30:27,819
of those who are trying to change the national regime.

307
00:30:34,310 --> 00:30:35,899
- [June 24, 1932]
- Commander General of Division 1

308
00:30:36,270 --> 00:30:38,939
has been assigned to visit provinces in the south

309
00:30:39,331 --> 00:30:41,099
since June 15.

310
00:30:41,961 --> 00:30:43,099
During this time,

311
00:30:43,353 --> 00:30:45,953
high-ranking soldiers who are still in the city

312
00:30:46,422 --> 00:30:48,659
including Ministry of Defense' Deputy Chief of Staff,

313
00:30:49,079 --> 00:30:50,339
Army Area Commander,

314
00:30:51,025 --> 00:30:52,619
and Chief of Staff for Royal Thai Army

315
00:30:52,934 --> 00:30:54,379
are not staying in the city.

316
00:30:55,051 --> 00:30:56,302
The members of royal family are not in the city

317
00:30:56,905 --> 00:30:58,939
so we can control the soldiers easier.

318
00:31:01,299 --> 00:31:02,300
Oh my goodness!

319
00:31:02,539 --> 00:31:05,140
The sources reported that the soldiers from our side were arrested.

320
00:31:05,603 --> 00:31:07,339
They were drunk and spilled our information

321
00:31:07,359 --> 00:31:08,819
about trying to transform the nation.

322
00:31:09,345 --> 00:31:10,346
What did you just say?

323
00:31:10,546 --> 00:31:13,779
They didn't tell on us yet or it would be a warrant already.

324
00:31:14,209 --> 00:31:15,299
But soon

325
00:31:15,410 --> 00:31:17,459
they will spill the members of this movement for sure.

326
00:31:17,606 --> 00:31:19,899
Phob, we don't have that much time. We need to do it.

327
00:31:20,401 --> 00:31:21,419
The longer we wait,

328
00:31:21,819 --> 00:31:23,859
the more information that the other side would get.

329
00:31:24,406 --> 00:31:26,579
We need to do something to transform the nation.

330
00:31:26,782 --> 00:31:29,339
Otherwise, we might not have another chance.

331
00:32:10,080 --> 00:32:12,081
[The King and Queen's schedule to visit Klai Kangwong Palace.]

332
00:32:16,603 --> 00:32:17,859
Phob? What are you looking for?

333
00:32:20,363 --> 00:32:21,364
I…

334
00:32:21,942 --> 00:32:22,943
Well…

335
00:32:24,379 --> 00:32:26,139
I am looking for my document?

336
00:32:27,259 --> 00:32:28,419
In my briefcase?

337
00:32:30,907 --> 00:32:33,619
I thought that perhaps

338
00:32:35,635 --> 00:32:37,179
you would accidentally pick up my document.

339
00:32:38,953 --> 00:32:40,459
We've spent time together like all the time.

340
00:32:43,017 --> 00:32:44,018
You're right.

341
00:32:47,279 --> 00:32:48,419
That looks so good.

342
00:32:48,494 --> 00:32:49,495
I brought you some snacks.

343
00:32:51,071 --> 00:32:53,415
I'll clear it for you.

344
00:32:58,110 --> 00:32:59,111
Come on, have a seat.

345
00:33:04,014 --> 00:33:05,015
Here's your coffee.

346
00:33:06,030 --> 00:33:07,031
Thank you.

347
00:34:22,403 --> 00:34:23,404
Phob.

348
00:34:29,838 --> 00:34:31,019
Where are you going?

349
00:34:34,713 --> 00:34:35,714
Nowhere.

350
00:35:00,419 --> 00:35:02,859
Did you heard the rumor

351
00:35:03,779 --> 00:35:05,899
about a group trying to transform the nation?

352
00:35:08,574 --> 00:35:10,859
Two soldiers were drunk and they spilled it.

353
00:35:15,305 --> 00:35:16,779
I heard about it.

354
00:35:18,699 --> 00:35:20,179
You need to be careful.

355
00:35:23,470 --> 00:35:26,219
Don't be around this group ever.

356
00:35:29,827 --> 00:35:31,419
My dad used to suspect you

357
00:35:32,901 --> 00:35:34,419
and I didn't want youto be in danger.

358
00:35:43,859 --> 00:35:44,860
Your Highness,

359
00:35:46,033 --> 00:35:47,059
if one day

360
00:35:48,838 --> 00:35:50,299
I did something terrible to you,

361
00:35:52,889 --> 00:35:54,539
will you forgive me?

362
00:35:58,459 --> 00:36:01,699
Why are you asking me this?

363
00:36:03,158 --> 00:36:04,539
I'm just worried

364
00:36:07,795 --> 00:36:09,019
that it could be something

365
00:36:10,969 --> 00:36:12,299
to upset you in the future.

366
00:36:13,150 --> 00:36:14,229
And you would leave me because of it.

367
00:36:16,323 --> 00:36:17,739
I don't want that day to come.

368
00:36:23,433 --> 00:36:24,434
Listen to me,

369
00:36:26,059 --> 00:36:27,819
if you don't leave me

370
00:36:29,448 --> 00:36:31,779
I won't leave you for sure.

371
00:36:34,382 --> 00:36:37,683
When you were not around, I was so tortured.

372
00:36:39,659 --> 00:36:41,449
I won't let it happen again.

373
00:37:45,183 --> 00:37:46,779
You're working for the army?

374
00:37:49,363 --> 00:37:50,464
What kind of liquor did you drink?

375
00:37:51,305 --> 00:37:53,339
You were so drunk and said something so rebellious.

376
00:37:53,939 --> 00:37:57,499
You shouldn't pay attention to little thing like this.

377
00:38:00,563 --> 00:38:02,219
I told you already

378
00:38:02,995 --> 00:38:04,859
that it was just a joke.

379
00:38:05,838 --> 00:38:06,839
It is not real story.

380
00:38:13,299 --> 00:38:14,459
Let's say that it was a joke,

381
00:38:16,057 --> 00:38:17,739
like something you said among friends,

382
00:38:19,625 --> 00:38:22,739
tell me, who are your friends to discuss it with?

383
00:38:28,952 --> 00:38:30,699
Do you want me to bring you to the palace

384
00:38:31,624 --> 00:38:32,699
so you will give me names?

385
00:38:34,249 --> 00:38:37,109
Do you want to see miniter of interior?

386
00:38:38,510 --> 00:38:41,819
Tell me, who are working with you in this disgraceful mission?

387
00:38:48,099 --> 00:38:49,100
Tell me!

388
00:38:56,267 --> 00:38:57,629
Write down the names.

389
00:38:59,489 --> 00:39:01,420
You can still keep your head attached to your shoulders,

390
00:39:03,019 --> 00:39:04,659
I will tell them to lower your penalty.

391
00:39:28,145 --> 00:39:30,299
They won't spill anything.

392
00:39:30,961 --> 00:39:33,819
I think we need to use harsher methods

393
00:39:34,203 --> 00:39:35,204
to get them to speak.

394
00:39:36,985 --> 00:39:38,139
They're so ungrateful to the nation.

395
00:39:39,043 --> 00:39:40,779
I don't know what their plans are

396
00:39:42,024 --> 00:39:43,619
but we need to be cautious.

397
00:39:45,937 --> 00:39:48,219
Tinnakorn are leaving the city quite often.

398
00:39:48,907 --> 00:39:50,259
I'm worried about him.

399
00:39:50,630 --> 00:39:53,169
What? The Royal Palace Office

400
00:39:53,473 --> 00:39:55,659
didn't have any work in the country lately.

401
00:39:57,361 --> 00:39:58,362
None?

402
00:39:59,425 --> 00:40:01,259
Well, I'm not sure.

403
00:40:01,686 --> 00:40:02,687
Perhaps, they have to leave the city.

404
00:40:02,987 --> 00:40:05,939
Otherwise, your son wouldn't tell you

405
00:40:06,262 --> 00:40:07,619
that he needed to work in the country.

406
00:41:10,733 --> 00:41:11,734
Phob!

407
00:41:13,592 --> 00:41:15,229
It's not fair.

408
00:41:19,483 --> 00:41:21,484
I was supposed to surprise you with it.

409
00:41:23,456 --> 00:41:24,457
What?

410
00:41:25,549 --> 00:41:26,929
Did you buy me a ring?

411
00:41:49,650 --> 00:41:50,651
P T.

412
00:41:52,829 --> 00:41:53,830
Phobthee.

413
00:41:55,491 --> 00:41:56,492
Tinnakorn.

414
00:42:05,181 --> 00:42:07,069
Phob, do you like it?

415
00:42:08,669 --> 00:42:10,949
I asked them to make it special for us.

416
00:42:15,085 --> 00:42:16,086
Of course, I do.

417
00:42:17,669 --> 00:42:18,749
I really like it.

418
00:42:20,344 --> 00:42:21,349
Thank you so much.

419
00:42:24,088 --> 00:42:25,089
Phob! Oh!

420
00:42:56,344 --> 00:42:57,345
Phob.

421
00:44:52,136 --> 00:44:53,840
We will stay like this,

422
00:44:54,200 --> 00:44:55,601
and be happy like this

423
00:44:56,401 --> 00:44:57,402
forever.

424
00:44:59,294 --> 00:45:01,720
- I want to call off the engagement with Ruethaisiri.
- Tin!

425
00:45:03,837 --> 00:45:06,000
Get it together! Is it why

426
00:45:06,083 --> 00:45:07,870
you don't want to get information from Prince Tinnakorn?

427
00:45:07,923 --> 00:45:11,520
We should carry out the change in government on Friday, June 24.

428
00:45:11,715 --> 00:45:12,716
The next two days?

429
00:45:13,950 --> 00:45:14,951
Can you wait for me here

430
00:45:15,230 --> 00:45:16,760
for the next two days?

431
00:45:16,947 --> 00:45:17,948
Whatever happens

432
00:45:18,638 --> 00:45:20,039
from now on,

433
00:45:20,530 --> 00:45:22,000
please remember one thing,

434
00:45:22,640 --> 00:45:24,440
I never meant to hurt you.

435
00:45:29,435 --> 00:45:31,160
I know where your son is.

